  "content": "<p><a href=\"https://serilum.com/\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/header/header.png\" alt=\"一款 Serilum 模組。用心製作。適用於 Fabric、Forge 和 Neo 的眾多活躍模組！\" width=\"838\" height=\"400\"></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/members/serilum/projects\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/curseforge.svg&w=400\" alt=\"CurseForge\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/user/Serilum\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/modrinth.svg&w=400\" alt=\"Modrinth\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://patreon.com/serilum\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/patreon.svg&w=400\" alt=\"Patreon\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://youtube.com/@serilum\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/youtube.svg&w=400\" alt=\"YouTube\" width=\"200\"></a></p>\n<h2><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/about-the-mod.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"關於此模組\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span>Stack Refill 是一個實用模組，當玩家背包中有相同物品時，會自動補充玩家手中的物品堆疊。它適用於戰鬥中的武器、挖掘方塊時的工具、放置方塊時的堆疊、進食、使用藥水、投擲物品、飲用牛奶桶、釣竿斷裂時，亦能與所有模組方塊相容。這是我個人最喜歡的生活品質改進之一。<br><br>為獲得最佳效果，必須在<strong>客戶端</strong>和<strong>伺服器端</strong>同時安裝。僅在伺服器端安裝也可使用，但可能導致部分視覺不同步。</span></p>\n<h2><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/dependencies.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"依賴項目\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/collective\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/requires/collective.svg&w=502\" alt=\"需要 Collective\" width=\"251\" height=\"49\"></a><br><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/modpack/the-vanilla-experience\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/the-vanilla-experience.svg&w=700\" alt=\"包含於 The Vanilla Experience\" width=\"350\" height=\"49\"></a><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/serilums-qol-bundle\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/qol-bundle.svg&w=668\" alt=\"包含於 Serilum's QoL Bundle\" width=\"334\" height=\"49\"></a><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/environment/both.svg&w=586\" alt=\"環境：客戶端與伺服器端\" width=\"293\" height=\"49\"></p>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/showcase.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"展示\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span><strong>戰鬥中自動更換劍的過程：</strong></span></p>\n<details><summary>顯示內容</summary>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/stack-refill/a.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1000\" height=\"584\"></p>\n</details>\n<p><br><span><strong>挖掘泥土時自動更換鏟子的過程：</strong></span></p>\n<details><summary>顯示內容</summary>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/stack-refill/b.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1000\" height=\"584\"></p>\n</details>\n<p><br><span><strong>放置木塊時自動補充的過程：</strong></span></p>\n<details><summary>顯示內容</summary>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/stack-refill/c.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1000\" height=\"586\"></p>\n</details>\n<p><br><span><strong>食用麵包後自動補充的過程：</strong></span></p>\n<details><summary>顯示內容</summary>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/stack-refill/d.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1000\" height=\"588\"></p>\n</details>\n<p><br><span><strong>使用藥水後自動補充的過程：</strong></span></p>\n<details><summary>顯示內容</summary>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/stack-refill/e.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1000\" height=\"588\"></p>\n</details>\n<p><br><span><strong>投擲物品後自動補充的過程：</strong></span></p>\n<details><summary>顯示內容</summary>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/stack-refill/f.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1000\" height=\"608\"></p>\n</details>\n<p><br><span><strong>飲用牛奶桶後自動補充的過程：</strong></span></p>\n<details><summary>顯示內容</summary>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/stack-refill/g.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1000\" height=\"580\"></p>\n</details>\n<p>&nbsp;<br><span><strong>釣竿最後一次使用後自動更換新釣竿的過程：</strong></span></p>\n<details><summary>顯示內容</summary>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/stack-refill/h.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1000\" height=\"580\"></p>\n</details>\n<p><br><span><strong>對（模組）方塊使用物品時，例如 Ex Nihilo 的篩子：</strong></span></p>\n<details><summary>顯示內容</summary>\n<p><span><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/stack-refill/i.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1000\" height=\"516\"></span></p>\n</details>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/notes-n-links.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"備註與連結\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span><strong>您可以在任何模組包中自由使用此模組，前提是下載仍保留在 CurseForge 或 Modrinth 生態系統內。</strong></span><br><br><span><a href=\"https://serilum.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Serilum.com</a> 包含所有可用模組的概覽及更多資訊。</span><br><span><br>如有問題、想法、建議或其他事項，請查看&nbsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/Serilum/.issue-tracker\" target=\"_blank\">Github 倉庫</a>。感謝！</span><span><br><br></span></p>",
